  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lobby_OpeningBriefing
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sequenceId: Lobby_OpeningBriefing
  notes: 'Lobby opening briefing; movement and view are locked. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_Expanded_Native_English_Lobby_Mia_Commentary.md,
    stable marker Lobby_OpeningBriefing. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Good evening, Inspector. Field Companion Unit online. I'll be your partner
      tonight.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: All right.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: 'Tonight''s assignment is on the seventeenth floor: three household companion
      units scheduled for inspection.'
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: This is a routine service review.
    holdSeconds: 3.414151
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: You'll check how each unit has been operating in the home, identify any
      issues in its recent use, and decide whether its role in the household should
      be adjusted going forward.
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: As one of the most highly regarded inspectors at the world's largest companion-unit
      company, I'm confident you'll complete tonight's route successfully.
    holdSeconds: 9.074528
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: 'First, use the assignment terminal in this lobby to load the files for
      all three households. One additional detail: tonight''s inspections are on
      the same floor as your own residence.'
    holdSeconds: 12
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: 'Before you begin, take a moment to observe the lobby. You''ll see companion
      units working throughout the community:'
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: our company's defining product, and the most successful companion technology
      in the world.
    holdSeconds: 6.0556602
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
